Package: geomix
Type: Package
Title: GeoMix: Bayesian Spatial Mixture Modelling for Offshore Site Characterisation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Bradley", "Wakefield",
      email = "bradleyw@uow.edu.au",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Tools for fitting GeoMix models for spatial classification and
    prediction using Bayesian hierarchical mixture models. The package
    combines Potts latent class models, grouped Vecchia Gaussian process
    approximations, custom NIMBLE samplers, posterior prediction, and MCMC
    diagnostic utilities. Developed for offshore ground characterisation
    using geophysical and geotechnical data.
